comment0.text=\r\n\ Write\ a\ description\ of\ class\ Puzzle\ here.\r\n\ \r\n\ @author\ Juli\u00E1n\ David\ Castiblanco\ Real\ \r\n\ @version\ (a\ version\ number\ or\ a\ date)\r\n
comment1.params=h\ w
comment1.target=Puzzle(int,\ int)
comment1.text=\r\n\ Creates\ a\ Puzzle\ object\ with\ specified\ dimensions,\ initializing\ the\ board\ and\ its\ visual\ rectangles.\r\n
comment10.params=direction
comment10.target=void\ tilt(char)
comment10.text=\r\n\ Tilts\ the\ board\ in\ a\ specific\ direction\ (up,\ down,\ left,\ or\ right),\ moving\ tiles\ in\ that\ direction\ and\ applying\ group\ movement\ if\ tiles\ are\ glued.\r\n
comment11.params=
comment11.target=void\ tilt()
comment11.text=\r\n\ Solves\ the\ board\ layout\ from\ the\ initial\ to\ final\ state\ through\ a\ sequence\ of\ moves,\ applying\ transformations\ step-by-step.\r\n
comment12.params=
comment12.target=void\ exchange()
comment12.text=\r\n\ Swaps\ the\ initial\ and\ final\ board\ layouts,\ along\ with\ their\ visual\ rectangle\ positions,\ while\ maintaining\ visibility.\r\n
comment13.params=
comment13.target=void\ makeVisible()
comment13.text=\r\n\ Makes\ the\ board\ and\ its\ tiles\ visible,\ updating\ the\ colors\ of\ visual\ rectangles\ according\ to\ the\ current\ tile\ state.\ \r\n
comment14.params=
comment14.target=void\ makeInvisible()
comment14.text=\r\n\ Hides\ the\ board,\ removing\ the\ visibility\ of\ all\ visual\ rectangles\ on\ both\ the\ initial\ and\ final\ boards.\ \ \r\n
comment15.params=
comment15.target=void\ finish()
comment15.text=\r\n\ Ends\ the\ simulation,\ making\ the\ board\ invisible\ and\ clearing\ its\ references,\ which\ closes\ the\ program.\r\n
