comment4.params=row\ column\ color
comment4.target=void\ addTile(int,\ int,\ java.lang.String)
comment4.text=\r\n\ Adds\ a\ tile\ to\ a\ specific\ position\ on\ the\ board\ with\ the\ specified\ color,\ updating\ visibility\ if\ the\ board\ is\ visible.\r\n
