comment5.target=void\ deleteTile(int,\ int)
comment5.text=\r\n\ Deletes\ a\ tile\ from\ a\ specific\ position\ on\ the\ board,\ updating\ its\ color\ and\ visibility\ if\ the\ board\ is\ visible.\ \ \r\n
